WEBVTT

00:09.241 --> 00:09.379
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:11.000 --> 00:11.137
KIDS:Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊，是啊，队长！

00:12.448 --> 00:12.586
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

00:13.655 --> 00:13.793
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.724 --> 00:15.862
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:18.758 --> 00:18.896
♪ Who lives in a pineappleunder the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在海底的菠萝里？ ♪

00:21.068 --> 00:21.206
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:23.379 --> 00:23.517
♪ Absorbent and yellowand porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性强、黄色、多孔，就是他 ♪

00:24.931 --> 00:25.034
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:27.172 --> 00:27.310
♪ If nautical nonsensebe something you wish ♪
♪ 如果航海废话是你想要的 ♪

00:29.034 --> 00:29.172
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:31.241 --> 00:31.379
♪ Then drop on the deckand flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上，像鱼一样扑通扑通 ♪

00:33.241 --> 00:33.379
SpongeBob SquarePants!Ready?
海绵宝宝！准备好了吗？

00:34.931 --> 00:35.034
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants
♪ 海绵宝宝

00:37.000 --> 00:37.103
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants
♪ 海绵宝宝

00:39.965 --> 00:40.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants
♪ 海绵宝宝

00:41.275 --> 00:41.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants.
♪ 海绵宝宝。

