[ seagulls chirping]
[海鸥鸣叫]

01:02.241 --> 01:02.379
[ bubbling]
[冒泡]

01:04.620 --> 01:04.758
[ humming]
[嗡嗡声]

01:07.000 --> 01:07.137
Finished at last!
终于完成了！

01:09.344 --> 01:09.482
What do you boys think
of me masterpiece?
你们觉得怎么样
我的杰作？

01:12.034 --> 01:12.172
[ SpongeBob reads sign]
[海绵宝宝读标志]

01:16.241 --> 01:16.379
What!
That is totally unfair!
什么！
这完全不公平！

01:19.206 --> 01:19.344
Squidward's right,
that's totally unfair!
章鱼哥说得对
这完全不公平！

01:21.379 --> 01:21.517
Couldn't we get to work
earlier than 6:00 a.m.?
我们不能去上班吗
早上 6:00 之前？

01:23.137 --> 01:23.275
Like 5:30 a.m.?
比如早上 5 点 30 分？

01:25.172 --> 01:25.310
Or 5:00 a.m.?
Or 4:00 a.m.?
还是凌晨 5:00？
还是凌晨 4:00？

01:26.793 --> 01:26.931
Zip it.
拉上拉链。

01:29.379 --> 01:29.517
What the...?
什么……？

01:30.758 --> 01:30.896
The Chum Bucket open 23 hours!
Chum Bucket 23小时营业！

01:34.344 --> 01:34.482
So, that little piece
of flotsam Plankton
那么，那个小片段
浮游生物浮游物

01:37.241 --> 01:37.379
thinks he can stay open
longer than me, does he?
认为他可以保持开放
比我长，是吗？

01:40.034 --> 01:40.172
Sure. I don't know.
Why not?
当然。我不知道。
为什么不呢？

01:41.689 --> 01:41.827
Well, he's wrong!Oh, okay, sure.
好吧，他错了！哦，好吧，当然。

01:43.793 --> 01:43.931
As of now, the Krusty Krab
is open 24 hours!
截至目前，蟹堡王
是24小时营业的！

01:48.448 --> 01:48.586
Did you hear that,
Squidward?
你听到了吗，
章鱼哥？

01:50.965 --> 01:51.068
We get to keep working
and working and working
我们要继续工作
和工作和工作

01:54.000 --> 01:54.137
without ever
having to go home.
从来没有
不得不回家。

01:56.620 --> 01:56.758
I got to pinch myself
'cause I must be dreaming.
我得掐自己一下
因为我一定是在做梦。

02:01.379 --> 02:01.517
Ow!
噢！

02:02.448 --> 02:02.586
Ow!
噢！

02:03.655 --> 02:03.793
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！噢！噢！噢！

02:06.413 --> 02:06.551
Ow...!
哎呀……！

02:09.068 --> 02:09.172
Ow!
噢！

02:10.310 --> 02:10.448
Well, I'm not dreaming.
好吧，我不是在做梦。

02:13.965 --> 02:14.068
PLANKTON:
Open 24 hours, eh?
浮游生物：
24小时营业吧？

02:16.517 --> 02:16.655
[ chuckles]:
I knew he couldn't resist
[轻笑]：
我知道他无法抗拒

02:18.896 --> 02:19.000
staying open later than me.
比我开得晚。

02:20.862 --> 02:20.965
My evil plan
is working perfectly.
我的邪恶计划
工作正常。

02:23.448 --> 02:23.586
He'll run his employees
into the ground,
他会管理他的员工
进入地下，

02:26.586 --> 02:26.724
and when SpongeBob's mind
finally cracks from exhaustion,
当海绵宝宝的心思
终于因疲惫而崩溃，

02:30.379 --> 02:30.517
I'll get him to tell me
the secret Krabby Patty formula!
我会让他告诉我
蟹黄派的秘密配方！

02:33.758 --> 02:33.896
[ evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

02:39.000 --> 02:39.103
[ stops laughing]
[停止笑]

02:40.206 --> 02:40.344
Why aren't you laughing?
你为什么不笑？

02:41.793 --> 02:41.931
I've heard
this joke before.
我听说过
之前这个笑话。

02:43.689 --> 02:43.827
KRABS:
All right, everybody!
螃蟹：
好吧，大家！

02:45.793 --> 02:45.931
The Krusty Krab is
entering day three
of nonstop service!
蟹堡王是
进入第三天
不间断的服务！

02:50.310 --> 02:50.448
Let's give it up
for day three!
让我们放弃吧
第三天！

02:52.413 --> 02:52.551
Yee-haw!
Day three!
呀呀！
第三天！

02:54.689 --> 02:54.827
Krabby Patty, I don't care
if we have to stay open
克拉比帕蒂，我不在乎
如果我们必须保持开放

02:57.793 --> 02:57.931
till the day after
the end of time.
直到后天
时间的尽头。

02:59.896 --> 03:00.068
As long as I'm with you,
I'm complete.
只要我和你在一起
我完整了。

03:05.310 --> 03:05.448
Day ten of nonstop service!
不间断服务第十天！

03:07.862 --> 03:07.965
Mr. Krabs, can
I go home yet?
蟹老板，可以吗？
我回家了吗？

03:09.758 --> 03:09.896
No one goes home!
没人回家！

03:11.413 --> 03:11.551
Look at these bags
under my eyes.
看看这些包包
在我的眼皮底下。

03:13.275 --> 03:13.413
Even my bags have bags.
连我的包里都有包。

03:14.758 --> 03:14.896
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

03:16.275 --> 03:16.413
Quit your bellyaching,
Squidward.
别再闹肚子了
章鱼哥。

03:18.000 --> 03:18.137
You don't hear SpongeBob
complaining, do you?
你听不到海绵宝宝的声音
抱怨，你有吗？

03:20.551 --> 03:20.689
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y,
says I. ♪
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y，
我说。♪

03:25.344 --> 03:25.482
You can learn a few
things from that boy.
可以学几个
那个男孩的事情。

03:27.965 --> 03:28.068
Mr. Krabs, he is not normal.
蟹老板，他不正常。

03:30.517 --> 03:30.655
[ kissing moans]
[接吻呻吟声]

03:32.310 --> 03:32.448
All right, you can sit
down for five minutes.
好吧，你可以坐了
下来五分钟。

03:34.689 --> 03:34.827
Then it's back to work!
然后就回去工作了！

03:36.793 --> 03:36.931
[ loud thump]
[重击声]

03:38.862 --> 03:38.965
Drat! He's not collapsing
from exhaustion!
糟糕！他没有崩溃
来自疲惫！

03:42.827 --> 03:42.965
But with a little more pressure,
但压力再大一点，

03:44.551 --> 03:44.689
the Sponge will crack
like an egg.
海绵会破裂
像鸡蛋一样。

03:47.379 --> 03:47.517
Then I'll be there to feast on
the goo of his shattered psyche.
那我就去那里大饱口福
他破碎的心灵的粘液。

03:50.965 --> 03:51.068
[ slurping]
[吸吮]

03:52.413 --> 03:52.551
[ evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

03:54.655 --> 03:54.793
Ew! A spider bug.
呃！一只蜘蛛虫。

03:55.862 --> 03:55.965
[ groans]
[呻吟]

03:59.275 --> 03:59.413
Now, come on.
现在，来吧。

04:00.793 --> 04:00.931
MR. KRABS:
Krusty Krab!
先生。螃蟹：
蟹堡王！

04:02.379 --> 04:02.517
The restaurant
that never closes.
餐厅
永远不会关闭。

04:03.758 --> 04:03.896
You'd like to place an order?
您想下订单吗？

04:05.103 --> 04:05.241
10,000 Krabby Patties?
10,000 个蟹黄饼？

04:07.000 --> 04:07.103
We'll start your order
right away, Mr., uh, uh...
我们将开始您的订单
马上，先生，呃，呃……

04:10.068 --> 04:10.206
What was that name again?
那个名字又叫什么？

04:11.310 --> 04:11.448
Uh-huh. Peter Lankton.
嗯嗯。彼得·兰克顿.

04:13.689 --> 04:13.827
Wait a minute.
等一下。

04:15.344 --> 04:15.482
This isn't some kind of prank,
is it?
这不是什么恶作剧
是吗？

04:17.275 --> 04:17.413
Uh... no.
呃...不。

04:19.827 --> 04:19.965
Good. We'll call you when
it's ready, Mr. Lankton.
好的。我们会在什么时候给您打电话
准备好了，兰克顿先生。

04:21.793 --> 04:21.931
Kick it into high gear!
把它踢到高速档！

04:23.379 --> 04:23.517
We got a big order!
我们接到了一笔大订单！

04:25.551 --> 04:25.689
I'm counting on you, boy!
我指望你了，孩子！

04:27.172 --> 04:27.310
I need you to raise
that spatular!
我需要你来提高
那个抹刀！

04:28.517 --> 04:28.655
Yeah!
是的！

04:30.275 --> 04:30.413
And I need you to say
"Team Krusty Krab!"
我需要你说
“蟹堡王队！”

04:32.724 --> 04:32.862
Team Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王团队！

04:34.862 --> 04:34.965
That's me boy.
这就是我，男孩。

04:36.379 --> 04:36.517
Now, make me
10,000 patties!
现在，让我
一万个肉饼！

04:39.758 --> 04:39.896
And no breaks.
并且没有休息。

04:41.482 --> 04:41.620
Whoo-hoo! Did you
hear that, spatula?
呼呼！你有吗
听到了吗，铲子？

04:44.000 --> 04:44.103
You, me and 10,000
Krabby Patties.
你、我和一万个人
蟹肉饼。

04:47.241 --> 04:47.379
And the best part?
最好的部分是什么？

04:48.862 --> 04:48.965
No breaks.
没有休息。

04:50.482 --> 04:50.620
Wow!
哇！

04:52.344 --> 04:52.482
Day 15!
第15天！

04:53.965 --> 04:54.068
Give it up for day 15!
第15天就放弃吧！

04:55.931 --> 04:56.034
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...
♪ K-R-A-B-B-Y P-A-T-T-Y...

04:58.655 --> 04:58.793
[ evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

05:01.241 --> 05:01.379
One thousand,
three hundred, twenty...
一千，
三百、二十……

05:02.758 --> 05:02.896
Day 23!
第23天！

05:04.896 --> 05:05.000
Give it up for day 23!
第23天就放弃吧！

05:06.344 --> 05:06.482
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
6,654...
