05:17.000 --> 05:17.137
Wait, what's going on?
等等，这是怎么回事？

05:18.896 --> 05:19.000
Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哇！

05:20.517 --> 05:20.655
Day...
天...

05:22.137 --> 05:22.275
Anyone know
how many days it's been?
有谁知道
已经多少天了？

05:23.517 --> 05:23.655
I lost track.
我迷失了方向。

05:26.000 --> 05:26.103
Forty-three.
四十三岁。

05:27.310 --> 05:27.448
[ gasps]
[喘气]

05:33.000 --> 05:33.137
What the flimflam?!
什么胡言乱语？

05:35.000 --> 05:35.137
What are you doing
in here, boy?
你在做什么
在这里吗，孩子？

05:37.482 --> 05:37.620
You're wasting
all me food.
你在浪费
都是我的食物。

05:39.827 --> 05:39.965
Boy?
男生？

05:41.310 --> 05:41.448
Oh! Oh-oh-oh!
哦！哦哦哦！

05:42.724 --> 05:42.862
Oh...
哦...

05:43.896 --> 05:44.000
Oh, hey, Mr. Krabs.
哦，嘿，蟹老板。

05:45.137 --> 05:45.275
When did you get in here?
你什么时候进来的？

05:46.620 --> 05:46.758
Boy, I'm worried that...
孩子，我担心...

05:48.137 --> 05:48.275
[ muffled talking]
[低声说话]

05:50.310 --> 05:50.448
Got it?
知道了？

05:51.517 --> 05:51.655
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

05:53.068 --> 05:53.206
Uh, could you run that
by me again?
呃，你能运行一下吗
又是我吗？

05:54.862 --> 05:54.965
Sure, I said,
I'm worried that...
当然，我说，
我担心...

05:56.965 --> 05:57.068
[ muffled talking]
[低声说话]

05:59.413 --> 05:59.551
That's what I thought
you said.
我就是这么想的
你说。

06:01.068 --> 06:01.206
Now, let me offer this
as a rebuttal.
现在，让我提供这个
作为反驳。

06:02.586 --> 06:02.724
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

06:03.931 --> 06:04.034
Stay back! I'm warning you!
退后！我警告你！

06:05.724 --> 06:05.862
All right,
now you're just acting silly.
好吧，
现在你只是表现得很愚蠢。

06:07.275 --> 06:07.413
I want you to...
我要你...

06:08.551 --> 06:08.689
[ muffled talking]
[低声说话]

06:09.793 --> 06:09.931
No! Don't eat me!
不！别吃我！

06:11.241 --> 06:11.379
I'm too chewy! [ screaming]
我太耐嚼了！ [尖叫]

06:13.275 --> 06:13.413
[ gasping]
[喘气]

06:18.793 --> 06:18.931
Holy shrimp!
They're everywhere!
圣虾！
他们无处不在！

06:20.724 --> 06:20.862
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

06:23.586 --> 06:23.724
[ muffled]:
What?
[低沉]：
什么？

06:24.724 --> 06:24.862
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

06:25.827 --> 06:25.965
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

06:26.965 --> 06:27.068
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

06:28.034 --> 06:28.172
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

06:29.172 --> 06:29.310
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

06:30.758 --> 06:30.896
I told you that
shirt was hideous.
我告诉过你
衬衫很难看。

06:32.034 --> 06:32.172
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

06:34.137 --> 06:34.275
No, no! I want to live!
不，不！我想活下去！

06:37.206 --> 06:37.344
I want to live!
我想活下去！

06:41.586 --> 06:41.724
Mr. Krabs...
what's going on?
蟹老板...
发生什么事了？

06:44.275 --> 06:44.413
Everywhere I look, I see
killer Krabby Patties.
无论我往何处看，我都能看到
杀手蟹蟹肉饼。

06:47.068 --> 06:47.206
There, there.
那里，那里。

06:48.862 --> 06:48.965
I'm sure it's nothing
that getting back
我确信这没什么
回来的那个

06:50.413 --> 06:50.551
to work won't solve.
工作解决不了问题。

06:51.655 --> 06:51.793
Here's your spatular.
这是你的抹刀。

06:53.275 --> 06:53.413
Spatular.
锅铲。

06:54.517 --> 06:54.655
And here's the grill.
这是烤架。

06:56.241 --> 06:56.379
Grill.
炙烤。

06:57.689 --> 06:57.827
And here are some
fresh Krabby...
这里有一些
新鲜的蟹...

06:59.620 --> 06:59.758
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

07:03.551 --> 07:03.689
[ continues screaming]
[继续尖叫]

07:05.793 --> 07:05.931
Hmm, there may be
a problem after all.
嗯，可能有
毕竟是个问题。

07:07.689 --> 07:07.827
What does this mean?
这意味着什么？

07:09.482 --> 07:09.620
It means there's something
wrong with your head.
这意味着有东西
你的头有问题。

07:11.482 --> 07:11.620
Look, I think maybe
you should see a professional.
听着，我想也许
你应该去看专业人士。

07:14.137 --> 07:14.275
Wrestler?No! A psychiatrist.
摔跤手？不！一位精神科医生。

07:16.034 --> 07:16.172
Oh, but where am I going to
find a psychiatrist...
哦，但是我要去哪里
找心理医生...

07:18.103 --> 07:18.241
Ow!
噢！

07:20.896 --> 07:21.000
Hey, look at this.
嘿，看看这个。

07:22.137 --> 07:22.275
[ SpongeBob reads]
[海绵宝宝读]

07:27.000 --> 07:27.137
Gosh, I don't know
about this, Mr. Krabs.
天哪，我不知道
关于这件事，蟹老板。

07:28.862 --> 07:28.965
Wouldn't I have to miss
work if I went to see...
难道我就不必错过
工作如果我去看...

07:30.655 --> 07:30.793
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

07:32.448 --> 07:32.586
Well, this looks like the place.
嗯，这看起来就是这个地方。

07:38.206 --> 07:38.344
Uh, hello? Doctor?
呃，你好？医生？

07:40.344 --> 07:40.482
Come in,
Mr. SquarePants.
进来吧，
方裤先生。

07:41.965 --> 07:42.068
Please, have a seat
on the couch.
请坐
在沙发上。

07:46.172 --> 07:46.310
Now... [ chuckles]
现在...[轻笑]

07:48.413 --> 07:48.551
let's unload
all that harmful information
让我们卸载
所有这些有害信息

07:51.241 --> 07:51.379
in your little yellow head.
在你的黄色小脑袋里。

07:53.586 --> 07:53.724
You're a bit smaller
than I imagined, Doctor.
你有点小
比我想象的还要多，医生。

07:55.517 --> 07:55.655
But I guess that's why
they call you a shrink.
但我想这就是原因
他们称你为心理医生。

07:57.586 --> 07:57.724
[ laughs, then
clears throat]
[笑，然后
清嗓子]

07:59.310 --> 07:59.448
Do you think there's hope
for me, Doctor?
你觉得还有希望吗
为了我，医生？

08:01.241 --> 08:01.379
Hope? Hope!? When I get
my hands on that formula,
希望？希望！？当我得到
我手上那个公式，

08:03.000 --> 08:03.103
there won't be any hope
for any of you.
不会有任何希望
对于你们任何一个人来说。

08:04.793 --> 08:04.931
[ laughs]
[笑]

08:06.482 --> 08:06.620
[ clears throat]:
Yeah, I mean...
[清嗓子]：
是的，我的意思是...

08:07.896 --> 08:08.000
you'll be cured in no time.
你很快就会痊愈的。

08:10.448 --> 08:10.586
Oh, good.
哦，很好。

08:12.000 --> 08:12.137
Let's start with
a simple exercise.
让我们从
一个简单的练习。

08:13.482 --> 08:13.620
Jumping jacks?
开合跳？

08:14.862 --> 08:14.965
I want you to close your eyes.
我要你闭上眼睛。

08:18.862 --> 08:18.965
Tighter.
更紧。

08:20.000 --> 08:20.103
Tighter.
更紧。

08:21.103 --> 08:21.241
Too tight!
太紧了！

08:22.448 --> 08:22.586
Now, tell me what you see.
现在，告诉我你看到了什么。

08:24.862 --> 08:24.965
I see giant
Krabby Patties.
我看见巨人
蟹肉饼。

08:28.206 --> 08:28.344
Good! And what are they made of?
好的！它们是由什么制成的？

08:31.068 --> 08:31.206
Hatred!
仇恨！

08:32.344 --> 08:32.482
No, I mean ingredients.
不，我是说成分。

08:34.000 --> 08:34.137
What are the stinking
ingredients?!
有什么臭味
成分？！

08:35.241 --> 08:35.379
They're coming for me.
他们来找我了。

08:36.310 --> 08:36.448
No! No! No!
不！不！不！

08:37.482 --> 08:37.620
Stay back!
退后！

08:39.068 --> 08:39.206
Wait, where'd you get
that piano?
等等，你从哪里得到的
那架钢琴？

08:42.206 --> 08:42.344
[ groans]
[呻吟]

08:43.758 --> 08:43.896
We're trying
something else.
我们正在努力
其他的东西。

08:46.034 --> 08:46.172
I'm going to say a word,
and I want you to say
我要说一句话，
我想让你说

08:48.965 --> 08:49.068
the first word
that pops into your head.
第一个词
这会突然出现在你的脑海中。

08:51.379 --> 08:51.517
Ready?
准备好？

08:52.689 --> 08:52.827
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

08:54.000 --> 08:54.103
Work.Work.
工作，工作。

08:55.103 --> 08:55.241
Spatula.
抹刀。

08:56.137 --> 08:56.275
Spatula.
抹刀。

08:57.310 --> 08:57.448
Bun.
Bun.
包子。
包子。

08:59.137 --> 08:59.275
See, the key is
to say something
你看，关键是
说某事

09:01.344 --> 09:01.482
different than what I say.
和我说的不一样。

09:03.862 --> 09:03.965
Oh,okay, I got it.
哦，好吧，我明白了。

09:05.965 --> 09:06.068
Potato.Po-tah-to.
马铃薯。Po-tah-to。

09:07.310 --> 09:07.448
Tomato.To-mah-to.
番茄.To-mah-to.

09:09.586 --> 09:09.724
I've laid out some words
on cards here.
我已经列出了一些话
在这里的卡片上。

09:12.758 --> 09:12.896
These words are
common kitchen ingredients.
这些话是
常见的厨房配料。

09:15.344 --> 09:15.482
I want you to arrange them
in any order you choose.
我要你安排他们
按照您选择的任何顺序。

09:18.379 --> 09:18.517
It could be a poem
or a secret formula,
这可能是一首诗
或秘密配方，

09:21.206 --> 09:21.344
I don't know-- oh, yes!
我不知道——哦，是的！

09:22.965 --> 09:23.068
A secret formula, good.
秘方，不错。

09:24.827 --> 09:24.965
Let's do that.
让我们这样做吧。

09:26.862 --> 09:26.965
Um, you're making
me nervous.
嗯，你正在做
我紧张。

09:29.206 --> 09:29.344
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

09:31.000 --> 09:31.137
I'll be over here, then.
那我就到这里吧

09:32.758 --> 09:32.896
I'm finished!
我完了！

09:36.000 --> 09:36.103
I arranged them
into a piano.
我安排了他们
变成一架钢琴。

09:37.551 --> 09:37.689
[ loud crash]
[巨响]

09:39.241 --> 09:39.379
Since your mind
has been resistant
自从你的心
已产生抵抗力

09:41.379 --> 09:41.517
to every mental technique
so far,
每一种心理技巧
到目前为止，

09:43.310 --> 09:43.448
I'm forced to resort
我被迫求助

09:45.034 --> 09:45.172
to my most powerful method
of curing you.
以我最有力的方法
治愈你。

09:47.586 --> 09:47.724
Fiber?
纤维？

09:48.896 --> 09:49.000
No. Hypnosis.
不，催眠。

09:51.034 --> 09:51.172
Hypnosis?!
催眠？！

09:52.689 --> 09:52.827
Now, keep your eyes
on this watch.
现在，请留心
在这款手表上。

09:54.965 --> 09:55.068
When I count to three,
you will fall into a deep sleep.
当我数到三时
你会陷入深度睡眠。

09:59.379 --> 09:59.517
One...
一...

10:00.862 --> 10:00.965
uh, two...
呃，两个……

10:02.482 --> 10:02.620
uh, three.
呃，三个。

10:03.862 --> 10:03.965
[ snoring]
[打鼾]

10:07.620 --> 10:07.758
I can't believe it worked.
我不敢相信它有效。

10:09.137 --> 10:09.275
Now, when I snap my fingers,
现在，当我打响指时，

10:12.482 --> 10:12.620
you will awake
and tell me the formula.
你会醒来
并告诉我公式。

10:16.000 --> 10:16.137
[ snaps fingers]
[打响指]

10:17.620 --> 10:17.758
[ snaps fingers quickly]
[快速打响指]

10:19.172 --> 10:19.310
Hey... wake up!
喂……醒醒吧！

10:20.827 --> 10:20.965
[ snoring continues]
[鼾声继续]

10:22.379 --> 10:22.517
[ cymbals clash]
[铙钹碰撞]

10:26.000 --> 10:26.137
Hmm, what else is
loud and obnoxious?
嗯，还有什么
又吵又讨厌？

10:29.103 --> 10:29.241
[ cell phone plays
electronic melody]
[ 手机播放
电子旋律]

10:31.241 --> 10:31.379
Why won't you wake up?!
你怎么还不醒？！

10:34.551 --> 10:34.689
♪ La, la, la, la, la,
la, la, la, la ♪
♪ 啦，啦，啦，啦，啦，
啦啦啦啦♪

10:36.620 --> 10:36.758
♪ La, la, la, la, la
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦

10:38.241 --> 10:38.379
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

10:39.344 --> 10:39.482
[ roaring]
[咆哮]

10:43.517 --> 10:43.655
Where am I?
我在哪里？

10:52.965 --> 10:53.068
[ SpongeBob whimpering][ slurping, growling]
[海绵宝宝呜咽][吸食，咆哮]

10:56.379 --> 10:56.517
Hey, SpongeBob, I heard
your brain was sick
嘿，海绵宝宝，我听说
你的脑子有病

10:58.896 --> 10:59.000
so I brought you
this cookie pizza.
所以我带你来了
这个饼干披萨。

11:00.448 --> 11:00.586
Gee, thanks.
哎呀，谢谢。

11:02.241 --> 11:02.379
And here's some
chocolate milk.
这是一些
巧克力牛奶。

11:03.827 --> 11:03.965
The king
of flavored dairy drinks!
国王
风味乳饮料！

11:06.551 --> 11:06.689
Oh, Krabby Patty,
哦，克拉比·帕蒂，

11:08.206 --> 11:08.344
I'm so glad
we're friends again.
我很高兴
我们又成为朋友了。

11:10.551 --> 11:10.689
Just remember, SpongeBob,
I'll always be with you,
请记住，海绵宝宝，
我会永远和你在一起

11:14.103 --> 11:14.241
right here.In my heart?
就在这里，在我心里？

11:16.379 --> 11:16.517
Actually, in
your arteries.
事实上，在
你的动脉。

11:18.310 --> 11:18.448
Now, do me a favor
and wake up.
现在，帮我一个忙
然后醒来。

11:20.275 --> 11:20.413
Wake up.
醒来吧。

11:21.344 --> 11:21.482
Wake up...!
醒醒吧……！

11:24.689 --> 11:24.827
[ groaning, yawning]
[呻吟，打哈欠]

11:28.586 --> 11:28.724
It worked! I'm cured!
成功了！我痊愈了！

11:30.482 --> 11:30.620
But what about the formula?
但是公式呢？

11:32.000 --> 11:32.103
Oh, you're right!
哦，你说得对！

11:33.482 --> 11:33.620
I better get
back to work!
我最好得到
回去工作吧！

11:34.827 --> 11:34.965
Thanks for everything, Doc!
谢谢你所做的一切，医生！

11:35.931 --> 11:36.034
No! It's a lie!
不！这是一个谎言！

11:38.551 --> 11:38.689
Therapy doesn't really work!
治疗确实没有效果！

11:40.551 --> 11:40.689
You're still sick!
你还病着呢！

11:42.275 --> 11:42.413
Very, very sick!
病得非常非常严重！

11:46.827 --> 11:46.965
Good to see your brain's
all fixed, boy.
很高兴看到你的大脑
一切都解决了，孩子。

11:49.689 --> 11:49.827
Yeah, I just needed
some sleep is all.
是的，我只是需要
睡一会儿就够了。

11:51.551 --> 11:51.689
Well, I can safely say,
no more 24-hour shifts...
嗯，我可以有把握地说，
不再24小时轮班了...

11:55.068 --> 11:55.206
'cause 23 hours'll be plenty.
[ laughing]
因为23小时足够了。
[笑]

11:58.000 --> 11:58.103
[ laughing]:
Aw, Mr. Krab...
[笑]：
噢，蟹老板……

11:59.862 --> 12:00.034
[ laughing]
[笑]

12:03.758 --> 12:03.896
No, seriously.
Get back to work!
不，说真的。
回去工作吧！

12:19.896 --> 12:20.000
Easy...
简单的...

12:24.896 --> 12:25.000
Perfection.
完美。

12:26.689 --> 12:26.827
Is number five's order
ready yet, SpongeBob?
是五号的命令吗
准备好了吗，海绵宝宝？

12:29.379 --> 12:29.517
Just a second, Squidward.
等一下，章鱼哥。

12:30.862 --> 12:30.965
Well, Krabby Patty,
好吧，克拉比·帕蒂，

12:32.172 --> 12:32.310
it's time for you to go now.
现在你该走了。

12:34.758 --> 12:34.896
You grew up so fast.
I...
你成长得真快。
我...

12:37.068 --> 12:37.206
[ crying]:
I promised myself
I wouldn't do this.
[哭泣]：
我答应自己
我不会这样做。

12:39.379 --> 12:39.517
Just take it, Squidward.
拿着它吧，章鱼哥。

12:40.689 --> 12:40.827
Take it away.
把它拿走。

12:43.793 --> 12:43.931
Oh, brother.
哦，兄弟。

12:45.344 --> 12:45.482
Number five.
Number five.
第五。
第五。

12:47.620 --> 12:47.758
That's me.
这就是我。

12:50.620 --> 12:50.758
Mmm. My compliments
to the chef.
嗯。代我向厨师致意。

12:52.448 --> 12:52.586
[ laughing]
[笑]

12:54.965 --> 12:55.068
Hello?
你好？

12:56.275 --> 12:56.413
What's this?
这是什么？

12:58.758 --> 12:58.896
[ gasps]
[喘气]

12:59.931 --> 13:00.103
Come out here, boy!
出来吧，孩子！

13:01.172 --> 13:01.310
[ flies buzzing]
[苍蝇嗡嗡叫]

13:02.896 --> 13:03.000
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

13:04.551 --> 13:04.689
Whoa!
哇！

13:06.586 --> 13:09.103
Hush, boy. Or you'll give away
your location of me hidey hole.
嘘，小伙子。或者你会放弃
你的位置是我的藏身之处。

13:09.103 --> 13:09.241
What's a hidey hole?
什么叫隐藏洞？

13:10.689 --> 13:10.827
It's where
I hide me treasure.
这是哪里
我隐藏我的宝藏。

13:12.896 --> 13:13.000
Whoa!
哇！

13:14.000 --> 13:14.137
Catch!
抓住！

13:15.793 --> 13:15.931
Let's get that chest
to me office, boy, pronto!
让我们得到那个胸部
到我办公室来，孩子，快点！

13:17.620 --> 13:17.758
What's in this thing?
Treasure?
这东西里有什么？
宝藏？

13:19.034 --> 13:19.172
A treasure trove of sorts.
某种宝库。

13:21.000 --> 13:21.137
It's me memory chest,
from my years in the navy.
这是我的记忆宝箱
从我在海军的这些年来看。

13:26.758 --> 13:26.896
Why'd you dig up
your navy chest, sir?
你为什么挖出来
先生，你的海军胸膛吗？

13:29.000 --> 13:29.137
Well, me navy buddies
and I are having a reunion.
好吧，我海军伙伴们
我正在聚会。

13:31.620 --> 13:31.758
I wanted to wear
me old uniform.
我想穿
我的旧制服。

13:34.724 --> 13:34.862
Wow, look at all
your cool navy stuff.
哇，全部看完了
你很酷的海军风格。

13:37.655 --> 13:37.793
What's that?
Arrgh!
那是什么？
啊啊！

13:39.241 --> 13:39.379
It's me first tattoo.
这是我第一个纹身。

13:41.379 --> 13:41.517
Neat.
整洁的。

13:42.896 --> 13:43.000
And this is me
manly toughness trophy.
这就是我
男子气概的韧性奖杯。

13:44.586 --> 13:44.724
How'd you win that?
你是怎么赢的？

13:46.172 --> 13:46.310
By being the toughest
of the tough.
成为最坚强的人
的坚韧。

13:48.068 --> 13:48.206
Wow! Ooh, ooh,
who are those guys?
哇！哦，哦，
那些人是谁？

13:50.482 --> 13:50.620
Me shipmates.
我这些船友。

13:52.310 --> 13:52.448
The toughest bunch
to ever sail the briny deep.
最难缠的一群
永远航行在海水深处。

13:54.241 --> 13:54.379
There's old Iron Eye
还有老铁眼

13:56.068 --> 13:56.206
and Mutton Chop, me,
还有羊排，我，

13:57.896 --> 13:58.000
Torpedo Belly
鱼雷腹

13:59.241 --> 13:59.379
and Lockjaw Jones.
和牙关紧闭的琼斯。

14:02.896 --> 14:03.000
Did you have
a cool nickname,
Mr. Krabs?
你有没有
一个很酷的昵称，
蟹老板？

14:04.620 --> 14:04.758
Of course!
当然！

14:06.000 --> 14:06.137
I was old Armor Abs Krabs.
我是老甲壳蟹蟹。

14:08.655 --> 14:08.793
You were?What do you mean?
你是？什么意思？

14:10.413 --> 14:10.551
Well, I guess you
were thinner back then.
嗯，我猜你
那时还瘦。

14:12.413 --> 14:12.551
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

14:13.931 --> 14:14.034
This is me
navy cadet uniform.
这就是我
海军学员制服。

14:16.000 --> 14:16.137
Prepare to eat your words,
准备好接受你的话，

14:17.896 --> 14:18.000
'cause I haven't
put on more...
因为我还没有
多穿点...

14:19.965 --> 14:20.068
than a... couple
of... pounds.
比...情侣
……磅。

14:22.172 --> 14:22.310
[ shirt ripping sound]
[衬衫撕裂声]

14:24.034 --> 14:24.172
Okay, maybe I'm a bit bigger,
好吧，也许我更大一点

14:27.482 --> 14:27.620
but I'm still the toughest
of the tough.
但我仍然是最坚强的
的坚韧。

14:29.482 --> 14:29.620
Go ahead, lad,
give 'em a punch.
来吧，小伙子，
给他们一拳。

14:31.344 --> 14:31.482
You want me to punch
you in the stomach?
你要我打拳
你在肚子里吗？

14:33.758 --> 14:33.896
Not in the stomach, lad,
in me armor abs.
不在肚子里，小伙子，
在我的盔甲腹肌中。

14:36.655 --> 14:36.793
[ clunk]
[沉闷]

14:38.827 --> 14:38.965
Wow.
哇。

14:40.344 --> 14:40.482
My entire arm
disintegrated!
我的整个手臂
解体了！

14:42.068 --> 14:42.206
I still got it.
我还是明白了。

14:43.896 --> 14:44.000
Be a good lad, go get
your station in shipshape,
做个好孩子，加油
你的车站状态良好，

14:46.551 --> 14:46.689
and leave an old sea dog
to revel in his memories.
并留下一条老海狗
陶醉在他的回忆中。

14:49.137 --> 14:49.275
Aye, aye, sir.
是啊，是啊，先生。

14:51.379 --> 14:51.517
All right!
好的！

14:52.965 --> 14:53.068
Let's get this place
shipshape!
让我们得到这个地方
船形！

14:54.448 --> 14:54.586
You men,
stop playing around!
你们这些男人，
别再玩了！

14:57.034 --> 14:57.172
To battle stations!
前往战斗站！

14:58.827 --> 14:58.965
All hands on deck!
所有的人都在甲板上！

15:00.275 --> 15:00.413
[ bosun's whistle blowing]
[水手长的哨子吹响]

15:02.241 --> 15:02.379
That calls for full flavor!
这就要求风味十足！

15:04.931 --> 15:05.034
Ketchup and mustard
off the port bow!
番茄酱和芥末
关闭左舷船头！

15:07.482 --> 15:07.620
One Krabby Patty
ready to set sail!
一份蟹肉饼
准备起航！

15:10.793 --> 15:10.931
KRABS:
No!
螃蟹：
不！

15:13.517 --> 15:13.655
Oh, Mr. Krabs.
哦，蟹老板。

15:15.000 --> 15:15.137
Huh, Mr. Krabs?
嗯，蟹老板？

15:19.827 --> 15:19.965
Hello?
你好？

15:21.000 --> 15:21.137
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

15:22.344 --> 15:22.482
You all right?
你还好吗？

15:23.482 --> 15:23.620
Are you sleepy?
你困了吗？

15:28.000 --> 15:28.103
[ gasps]
[喘气]

15:29.172 --> 15:29.310
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

15:30.379 --> 15:30.517
[ sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

15:31.620 --> 15:31.758
I don't smell his pulse.
我没闻到他的脉搏。

15:33.137 --> 15:33.275
What's that?
那是什么？

15:34.413 --> 15:34.551
[ muffled moaning]
[低沉的呻吟声]

15:36.620 --> 15:36.758
Is somebody there?
有人在吗？

15:38.068 --> 15:38.206
[ moaning]
[呻吟]

15:39.413 --> 15:39.551
Don't look at me.
别看我。

15:41.517 --> 15:41.655
Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板。

15:42.551 --> 15:42.689
Leave me be.
别管我了。

15:44.000 --> 15:44.137
You're alive!
你还活着！

15:45.689 --> 15:45.827
And... naked.
还有……赤身裸体。

15:47.482 --> 15:47.620
[ crying]:
It's true.
[哭泣]：
这是真的。

15:48.896 --> 15:49.000
I've molted.
我已经蜕皮了

15:50.758 --> 15:50.896
What's "molted"?
什么叫“蜕变”？

15:52.241 --> 15:52.379
It's when a crab
gets too fat--
正是螃蟹的时候
太胖了——

15:54.517 --> 15:54.655
uh, well--
outgrows his shell.
呃，好吧——
长得超出了他的壳。

15:56.655 --> 15:56.793
It falls off.
它会掉下来。

15:57.689 --> 15:57.827
Wow!
哇！

15:58.896 --> 15:59.000
Armor Abs Krabs can't show up
装甲腹肌蟹无法出现

16:00.931 --> 16:01.034
at the reunion like this.
在这样的聚会上。

16:03.241 --> 16:03.379
All pink and soft
and unmanly.
都是粉色的，温柔的
而且没有男子气概。

16:05.689 --> 16:05.827
I'm all flab and no ab!
我浑身松弛，没有腹肌！

16:09.310 --> 16:09.448
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

16:10.862 --> 16:10.965
Barnacles!
藤壶！

16:12.206 --> 16:12.344
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

16:13.931 --> 16:14.034
Sorry about the
foul language,
Mr. Krabs,
抱歉
脏话、
蟹老板先生，

16:15.965 --> 16:16.068
but you're acting like there
never was a man in that shell.
但你的表现就像在那里
那个壳里从来没有一个人。

16:18.448 --> 16:18.586
The Krabs
of his navy days was fearless.
蟹蟹们
他的海军生涯是无所畏惧的。

16:20.724 --> 16:20.862
He wouldn't let something
as insignificant
他不会让某事
一样微不足道

16:23.137 --> 16:23.275
as a missing shell
slow him down.
作为缺失的外壳
放慢他的速度。

16:24.896 --> 16:25.000
Yeah.
是的。

16:26.655 --> 16:26.793
Who cares how silly,
pink and fleshy you look?
谁在乎有多傻，
你看起来又粉又肉？

16:29.379 --> 16:29.517
How non-threatening,
limp, and soggy you are...
多么没有威胁，
你软弱无力，浑身湿透……

16:32.137 --> 16:32.275
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

16:33.275 --> 16:33.413
How... Oops.
怎么……哎呀。

16:34.689 --> 16:34.827
I can't go anywhere ever again.
我再也不能去任何地方了。

16:37.931 --> 16:38.034
Stupid, no good...
笨蛋，不好...

16:40.689 --> 16:40.827
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

16:42.827 --> 16:42.965
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

16:44.586 --> 16:44.724
[ sustained screaming]
[持续尖叫]

16:47.344 --> 16:47.482
Wow, it sure is dark in here.
哇，这里确实很黑。

16:50.137 --> 16:50.275
[ straining]
[紧张]

16:53.034 --> 16:53.172
Look, Mr. Krabs-- I'm you.
瞧，蟹老板——我就是你。

16:55.689 --> 16:55.827
SpongeBob, you're a genius.
海绵宝宝，你真是个天才。

16:58.034 --> 16:58.172
Well, I'm glad you got my point.
嗯，我很高兴你明白我的意思。

16:59.793 --> 16:59.931
It's not about
what's on the outside.
这不是关于
外面是什么。

17:01.517 --> 17:01.655
It's what's on the inside.
这就是里面的东西。

17:02.827 --> 17:02.965
No, you barnacle brain.
不，你这个藤壶脑。

17:04.724 --> 17:04.862
Not your silly metaphor;
you, in me shell.
不是你愚蠢的比喻；
你，在我的壳里。

17:07.793 --> 17:07.931
It gives me an idea.
它给了我一个想法。

17:09.586 --> 17:09.724
You can go to the reunion
and pretend to be me.
你可以去参加聚会
并假装是我。

17:13.103 --> 17:13.241
I get to be a navy buddy?
我能成为一名海军伙伴吗？

17:14.758 --> 17:14.896
Of course you'll need
some time
当然你需要
某个时间

17:16.517 --> 17:16.655
to approximate
me personality.
近似
我的个性。

17:18.137 --> 17:18.275
Oh, that'll be a snap.
哦，那会很简单。

17:19.793 --> 17:19.931
Squidward and I
have been doing it
章鱼哥和我
一直在做

17:21.344 --> 17:21.482
behind your
back for years.
在你的后面
回来很多年了。

17:22.793 --> 17:22.931
All right, show me what you got.
好吧，让我看看你得到了什么。

17:26.655 --> 17:26.793
[ imitating Krabs]:
Look at me. I'm Mr. Krabs.
【模仿螃蟹】：
看着我。我是蟹老板。

17:28.862 --> 17:28.965
I love money.
我爱钱。

17:30.103 --> 17:30.241
Say, that ain't half bad.
说吧，这还不错。

17:31.931 --> 17:32.034
I once won a marathon
我曾经赢得过马拉松比赛

17:33.724 --> 17:33.862
because someone dropped
a penny at the finish line.
因为有人掉下来了
终点线的一分钱。

17:35.586 --> 17:35.724
That's me.
这就是我。

17:37.689 --> 17:37.827
Every night, I tuck me wallet in
and tell it a bedtime story.
每天晚上我都会把钱包塞进去
并给它讲睡前故事。

17:41.827 --> 17:41.965
Good night, wallety.
晚安，钱包。

17:44.275 --> 17:44.413
Yeah, okay, I get the point.
是的，好吧，我明白了。

17:47.000 --> 17:47.137
Oh, what's that you say?
哦，你说什么？

17:48.724 --> 17:48.862
Me daughter Pearl needs
an operation?
我女儿珍珠需要
手术？

17:50.931 --> 17:51.034
I'll do it meself
and save a nickel.
我自己来做
并节省五分钱。

17:53.000 --> 17:53.103
[ cackling]
[咯咯笑]

17:55.448 --> 17:55.586
That'll do, SpongeBob.
就这样吧，海绵宝宝。

18:01.724 --> 18:01.862
Well, here goes...
好吧，这里...

18:03.137 --> 18:03.275
Wow.
哇。

18:05.206 --> 18:05.344
SPONGEBOB:
I've never seen
so many manly naval men.
海绵宝宝：
我从未见过
这么多有男子气概的海军士兵。

18:07.000 --> 18:07.137
So tough, so brave,
那么坚强，那么勇敢，

18:09.034 --> 18:09.172
so... clever.
太……聪明了。

18:11.586 --> 18:11.724
And I'm one of them.
我就是其中之一。

18:12.931 --> 18:13.034
No, you're not.
不，你不是。

18:14.551 --> 18:14.689
Don't blow this
for me, SpongeBob.
别吹这个
对我来说，海绵宝宝。

18:16.206 --> 18:16.344
I won't let you down, sir.
我不会让你失望的，先生。

18:18.103 --> 18:18.241
Armor
Abs Krabs,
装甲
蟹肉腹肌，

18:20.137 --> 18:20.275
come join your old
naval buddies in a toast.
来加入你的老
海军战友们举杯。

18:22.586 --> 18:22.724
Coming!
未来！

18:23.896 --> 18:24.000
Oh, what have I done?
哦，我做了什么？

18:26.620 --> 18:26.758
Okay, boys, let the S.S. Party
drop anchor right here.
好吧，伙计们，让党卫军派对吧
就在这里抛锚。

18:30.896 --> 18:31.000
[ cheering]
[欢呼]

18:32.206 --> 18:32.344
I've created a monster.
我创造了一个怪物。

18:34.310 --> 18:34.448
Here's some grog.
这是一些烈酒。

18:35.896 --> 18:36.000
You still like
pineapple, right?
你还是喜欢
菠萝，对吗？

18:38.448 --> 18:38.586
Like pineapple?
像菠萝吗？

18:39.551 --> 18:39.689
I live in one.
我住在一间。

18:40.689 --> 18:40.827
[ laughing]
[笑]

18:43.103 --> 18:43.241
That old Krabs
那个老蟹

18:44.793 --> 18:44.931
is as manly as ever.
一如既往的有男子气概。

18:46.551 --> 18:46.655
I don't believe it.
SpongeBob is pulling it off.
我不相信。
海绵宝宝正在成功。

18:48.793 --> 18:48.931
Hey, Armor Abs,
old Iron Eye here
嘿，装甲腹肌，
老铁眼在这里

18:51.000 --> 18:51.137
has been itching to punch
your legendary gut.
已经跃跃欲试
你传奇般的直觉。

18:54.413 --> 18:54.551
Well, if you think
you're man enough...
好吧，如果你认为
你够男人了...

18:56.586 --> 18:56.724
Uh-oh, this could be bad.
呃哦，这可能很糟糕。

18:58.551 --> 18:58.689
Fire the torpedo.
发射鱼雷。

19:05.275 --> 19:05.413
[ birds chirping]
[鸟鸣声]

19:07.068 --> 19:07.206
What do you say, Krabs?
蟹蟹你说什么？

19:08.517 --> 19:08.655
Just like old times.
就像过去一样。

19:11.241 --> 19:11.379
A tooth?
一颗牙齿？

19:12.793 --> 19:12.931
Teeth.
牙齿。

19:13.965 --> 19:14.068
Now, that's manly.
现在，这就是男子气概。

19:15.827 --> 19:15.965
[ crowd gasping]
[人群喘息]

19:18.068 --> 19:18.206
[ cheering]
[欢呼]

19:20.862 --> 19:20.965
He did it.
他做到了。

19:22.103 --> 19:22.241
[ feedback squeal]
[反馈尖叫声]

19:23.689 --> 19:23.827
All right, me swabbies,
好吧，我这个拭子，

19:26.000 --> 19:26.103
it's time to award the trophy
of manly toughness
是时候颁发奖杯了
具有男子气概的坚韧

19:30.413 --> 19:30.551
to a man whose toughness
has stood the test of time.
一个坚韧的人
经受住了时间的考验。

19:35.275 --> 19:35.413
That man is
Eugene Armor Abs Krabs!
那个男人是
尤金装甲腹肌螃蟹！

19:40.413 --> 19:40.551
Hey, come up here, Krabs.
嘿，过来吧，蟹蟹。

19:42.103 --> 19:42.241
This is the best night
of me life.
这是最美好的夜晚
我的生活。

19:44.448 --> 19:44.586
KRABS:
Me naval buddies still
think I'm manly.
螃蟹：
我还是海军伙伴
认为我很有男子气概。

19:46.862 --> 19:46.965
[ all chanting]:
Armor Abs!
[大家齐喊]：
装甲腹肌！

19:48.413 --> 19:48.551
And I didn't have
to shame myself.
而我没有
让我自己感到羞耻。

19:50.275 --> 19:50.413
Thanks for the trophy,
everybody.
谢谢你的奖杯，
大家。

19:52.275 --> 19:52.413
[ cackling]
[咯咯笑]

19:54.137 --> 19:54.275
[ chanting]:
Speech! Speech! Speech! Speech!
[念诵]：
演讲！演讲！演讲！演讲！

19:56.586 --> 19:56.724
I... I...
我...我...

19:57.793 --> 19:57.931
Say something.
说些什么。

19:59.172 --> 19:59.310
Let me spin you a manly yarn.
让我为你编织一段男子气概的故事。

20:01.793 --> 20:01.931
Attaboy.
阿塔博伊。

20:03.413 --> 20:06.103
So there I was,
in Jellyfish Fields...
于是我就在那里，
在水母田里...

20:06.103 --> 20:06.241
I'm doomed.
我注定了。

20:07.896 --> 20:08.000
Me supply of bubble soap
was dangerously low.
我供应泡泡皂
处于危险的低水平。

20:11.172 --> 20:11.310
And as I blew my last bubble...
当我吹灭最后一个泡沫时...

20:13.965 --> 20:14.068
Did he say
Jellyfish Fields?
他有说吗
水母田？

20:16.655 --> 20:16.793
Blowing bubbles?
吹泡泡？

20:18.379 --> 20:18.517
Uh, what were you doing
in Jellyfish Fields?
呃，你在做什么
在水母田？

20:20.827 --> 20:20.965
Why, jellyfishing, of course.
为什么，当然是捕水母。

20:22.793 --> 20:22.931
ALL:
Huh?!
全部：
啊？！

20:24.413 --> 20:24.551
Uh... uh, phone call
for Mr. Krabs!
呃……呃，打电话
为了蟹老板！

20:27.931 --> 20:28.034
Get off the stage.
下台吧。

20:29.551 --> 20:29.689
Oh, uh, well,
I gotta go. Thanks.
哦，呃，好吧，
我得走了。谢谢。

20:33.413 --> 20:33.551
Where do you think
you're going?
你认为哪里
你要去吗？

20:36.758 --> 20:36.896
Everybody knows
there's two things
大家都知道
有两件事

20:39.206 --> 20:39.344
old Armor Abs Krabs
would never do.
老装甲腹肌蟹
永远不会这样做。

20:41.620 --> 20:41.758
Oh, no.
哦，不。

20:43.344 --> 20:43.482
Number one is
spend a penny.
第一个是
花一分钱。

20:46.206 --> 20:46.344
And the other one is leave
另一种是请假

20:48.586 --> 20:48.724
without giving
old Torpedo Belly
不给予
老鱼雷腹部

20:51.310 --> 20:51.448
one of your world-famous
steely belly butts.
你的世界著名人物之一
钢铁般的腹屁股。

20:54.965 --> 20:55.068
[ laughing]
[笑]

20:57.172 --> 20:57.310
[ with own voice]:
Oh, I thought you'd
seen through my ruse.
[用自己的声音]：
哦，我以为你会
识破了我的诡计。

20:59.482 --> 20:59.620
[ imitating Krabs]:
I mean, arrgh!
【模仿螃蟹】：
我的意思是，啊！

21:01.379 --> 21:01.517
You didn't think
I was just gonna collect
你没想到
我只是想收集

21:03.931 --> 21:04.034
this here trophy
of manly toughness
这里的奖杯
具有男子气概的坚韧

21:06.034 --> 21:06.172
without reminding
yous lily-livers
没有提醒
你的百合肝

21:08.103 --> 21:08.241
why you give it to me
in the first place?
为什么你把它给我
首先？

21:10.517 --> 21:10.655
Let's have at it.
让我们来看看吧。

21:11.827 --> 21:11.965
No holding back.
毫不犹豫。

21:13.000 --> 21:13.137
Give it your all.
全力以赴。

21:14.344 --> 21:14.482
I can't watch.
我看不下去了

21:19.000 --> 21:19.137
[ yelling]
[大喊]

21:21.655 --> 21:21.793
Armor Abs?
装甲腹肌？

21:23.068 --> 21:23.206
[ grunting and groaning]
[咕哝和呻吟]

21:24.793 --> 21:24.931
[ yelling]
[大喊]

21:26.034 --> 21:26.172
Ow!
噢！

21:27.137 --> 21:27.275
[ rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

21:32.000 --> 21:32.137
Well, uh, I-I-I-I-I-I...
嗯，呃，我-我-我-我-我-我...

21:35.172 --> 21:35.310
I guess I'll just take
my manly toughness trophy
我想我会采取
我的男子汉坚韧奖杯

21:38.620 --> 21:38.758
and head home now.
现在就回家吧。

21:40.620 --> 21:40.758
Uh... see you around
Manville, boys... men.
呃...再见
曼维尔，孩子们……男人们。

21:44.103 --> 21:44.241
No!
不！

21:47.068 --> 21:47.206
He's not Eugene Krabs.
他不是尤金·克拉布斯。

21:49.517 --> 21:49.655
I am.
我是。

21:51.137 --> 21:51.275
[ gasps]
[喘气]

21:52.448 --> 21:52.586
All right, lads.
好吧，小伙子们。

21:54.413 --> 21:54.551
Take a good look.
好好看看。

21:56.551 --> 21:56.689
This is who I am.
这就是我。

21:58.896 --> 21:59.000
I've molted me shell
and I'm... vulnerable.
我已经蜕壳了
而我……很脆弱。

22:03.000 --> 22:03.103
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

22:04.827 --> 22:04.965
But I'm certainly
no bubble-blowing jellyfisher.
但我确信
没有吹泡泡的水母。

22:06.310 --> 22:06.448
No offense, SpongeBob.
无意冒犯，海绵宝宝。

22:07.551 --> 22:07.689
None taken, Mr. Krabs.
蟹老板，没有人被抓。

22:09.034 --> 22:09.172
Come on, lad.
Let's go home.
来吧，小伙子。
我们回家吧。

22:11.482 --> 22:11.620
Wait a minute.
等一下。

22:13.000 --> 22:13.103
You've forgotten something.
你忘记了一些事情。

22:15.827 --> 22:15.965
I don't understand.
我不明白。

22:18.482 --> 22:18.620
Admitting you lost
your shell
承认自己输了
你的外壳

22:21.586 --> 22:21.724
was the toughest thing
I've ever seen.
是最艰难的事情
我曾经见过。

22:25.793 --> 22:25.931
And, uh, I have
a confession.
而且，呃，我有
一个忏悔。

22:28.310 --> 22:28.448
These are fake!
这些都是假的！

22:30.931 --> 22:31.034
What?!Wha...?!
什么？！什么……？！

22:31.965 --> 22:32.068
Over here.
在这里。

22:33.586 --> 22:33.724
KRABS:
You too,
Torpedo Belly?
螃蟹：
你也一样，
鱼雷腹？

22:35.551 --> 22:35.689
Actually, I had my torpedo
removed long ago.
事实上，我有鱼雷
很久以前就被删除了。

22:39.448 --> 22:39.586
And these aren't the same
choppers that I had in the navy.
而且这些并不相同
我在海军拥有的直升机。

22:43.551 --> 22:43.689
My iron eye is
actually made of Formica.
我的铁眼是
实际上是由福米卡制成的。

22:47.103 --> 22:47.241
[ all laughing]
[全都笑了]

22:52.379 --> 22:52.517
Look at that, Mr. Krabs.
看看那个，蟹老板。

22:54.413 --> 22:54.551
Your navy buddies all had
something to hide.
你的海军伙伴都有
需要隐藏的东西。

22:57.379 --> 22:57.517
Yeah, poor suckers.
是的，可怜的傻瓜。

22:59.206 --> 22:59.344
At least my shell
will grow back.
至少我的壳
会重新长出来。

23:02.000 --> 23:02.103
[ cackling]
[咯咯笑]

23:03.689 --> 23:03.827
[ both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

23:09.000 --> 23:09.103
access.wgbh.org
访问.wgbh.org

访问.wgbh.org